          {
            "id": 3005,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C8dpdxPOqoVmyDxqo0PlWSITgGf\">Overall, Country A offered the most affordable education across all disciplines, while Country B charged the highest fees for technical subjects, namely computing and science. Notably, Country C maintained identical tuition costs for three out of the four academic programmes.</div>\n</div>",
