          {
            "id": 3006,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PUdsdknuSoknh0x0pb2lzIHXg8f\">Regarding STEM-related fields, computing and science courses in Country A both cost $18,000, which was considerably lower than in the other two nations. Country B had the most expensive fees for these subjects, at $27,254 and $28,675 respectively, approximately 50% higher than Country A. Meanwhile, Country C charged slightly less than Country B, with computing costing $21,783 and science standing at $24,569.</div>\n</div>",
